@startuml Summarize Workflow Sequence Diagram

title Transcript Summarization with Context Analysis

actor User
participant "React UI" as UI
participant "FastAPI\nGateway" as API
participant "Redis\nQueue" as Redis
participant "Celery\nWorker" as Worker
participant "LLM\nManager" as LLM
participant "Context\nService" as Context
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

== 1. User Initiates Summarization ==

User -> UI: Click "Start Summary"
activate UI

UI -> UI: Open Summary Dialog\nSelect options:\n- Model (gemma2:9b)\n- Type (detailed/investigation)\n- Include context (yes/no)

User -> UI: Configure & Submit

UI -> API: POST /api/v1/audio/v2/summarize/{task_id}\nBody: {\n  model_name: "gemma2:9b",\n  summary_type: "detailed",\n  include_context: true\n}
activate API

API -> DB: Get Task.result to extract transcript
activate DB
DB --> API: Return task.result.transcription
deactivate DB

alt Transcript not found
  API --> UI: Error 400: {\n  detail: "No transcript found.\n  Please transcribe first."\n}
  UI -> User: Show error notification
else Transcript exists

  API -> Redis: Enqueue summarize_task(task_id, params)
  activate Redis
  Redis --> API: Task queued
  deactivate Redis

  API -> DB: Update task.status = "summarizing"

  API --> UI: Return {\n  task_id: "...",\n  status: "summarizing",\n  celery_task_id: "..."\n}
  deactivate API

  UI -> UI: Start polling status\n(every 2 seconds)

end

== 2. Worker Processes Summarization ==

Redis -> Worker: Assign summarize_task
activate Worker

Worker -> DB: Get transcript from Task.result
activate DB
DB --> Worker: Return transcript text
deactivate DB

alt Include Context = true

  == 3. Context Analysis (Multi-layer) ==

  Worker -> Context: analyze_context(transcript)
  activate Context

  === Layer 1: Entity Extraction ===

  Context -> LLM: Extract entities from transcript
  activate LLM

  LLM -> LLM: Analyze text for:\n- People (names, roles)\n- Locations (addresses, places)\n- Organizations\n- Times, dates\n- Money, values

  LLM --> Context: Return entities[]:\n[\n  {type: "person", name: "Khách A", role: "customer"},\n  {type: "location", name: "Khách sạn Hilton"},\n  {type: "money", value: 1500000, currency: "VND"},\n  ...\n]
  deactivate LLM

  === Layer 2: Relationship Mining ===

  Context -> LLM: Extract relationships
  activate LLM

  LLM -> LLM: Analyze interactions:\n- Direct relationships\n- Hidden relationships\n- Influence mapping

  LLM --> Context: Return relationships[]:\n[\n  {from: "Khách A", to: "Nhân viên B", type: "communicates"},\n  {from: "Khách A", to: "Phòng Deluxe", type: "transacts"},\n  ...\n]
  deactivate LLM

  === Layer 3: Action & Decision Tracking ===

  Context -> LLM: Extract actions & decisions
  activate LLM

  LLM -> LLM: Identify:\n- Commitments\n- Offers\n- Decisions\n- Requests

  LLM --> Context: Return actions[]:\n[\n  {type: "commitment", actor: "Khách A", \n   action: "thanh toán", value: "1.5M VNĐ"},\n  {type: "decision", actor: "Khách A", \n   action: "đặt phòng", object: "Deluxe 2 đêm"},\n  ...\n]
  deactivate LLM

  === Layer 4: Risk & Anomaly Detection ===

  Context -> LLM: Detect anomalies & risks
  activate LLM

  LLM -> LLM: Check for:\n- Time contradictions\n- Evasion patterns\n- Suspicious language\n- Behavior changes

  LLM --> Context: Return anomalies[]:\n[\n  {type: "time_contradiction", \n   description: "Mentioned yesterday but..."},\n  {type: "evasion", severity: "low", ...},\n  ...\n]
  deactivate LLM

  === Layer 5: Deep Insights ===

  Context -> LLM: Generate insights
  activate LLM

  LLM -> LLM: Synthesize:\n- Key takeaways\n- Actionable intelligence\n- Recommendations\n- Missing information

  LLM --> Context: Return insights[]:\n[\n  "Khách đặt phòng Deluxe 2 đêm (25-26/12)",\n  "Cam kết thanh toán đặt cọc 50%",\n  "Chưa có xác nhận bằng văn bản",\n  ...\n]
  deactivate LLM

  Context --> Worker: Return full context_analysis:\n{\n  entities: [...],\n  relationships: [...],\n  actions: [...],\n  anomalies: [...],\n  risks: [...],\n  insights: [...]\n}
  deactivate Context

end

== 4. Generate Summary ==

Worker -> Worker: Build prompt based on summary_type

alt Summary Type = "brief"
  Worker -> Worker: prompt = "Tóm tắt ngắn gọn (1-2 câu)..."

else Summary Type = "detailed"
  Worker -> Worker: prompt = "Tóm tắt chi tiết (50-200 từ):\n- Nội dung chính\n- Điểm quan trọng\n- Kết luận..."

else Summary Type = "investigation"
  Worker -> Worker: prompt = "Phân tích điều tra:\n- Sự kiện theo thời gian\n- Nhân vật và vai trò\n- Dấu hiệu bất thường\n- Bằng chứng\n- Điểm cần làm rõ..."

end

Worker -> LLM: generate(prompt, model="gemma2:9b",\n  temperature=0.7, max_tokens=1024)
activate LLM

LLM -> LLM: Run LLM inference:\n- Load model (lazy)\n- Generate text\n- Apply constraints

LLM --> Worker: Return summary text:\n"Cuộc hội thoại giữa khách hàng A và\nnhân viên lễ tân về việc đặt phòng...\n[Chi tiết tóm tắt]"
deactivate LLM

== 5. Save Results ==

Worker -> Worker: Build result update:\n{\n  summary: "...",\n  context_analysis: {...},\n  summary_model: "gemma2:9b",\n  summary_type: "detailed"\n}

Worker -> DB: Get current Task.result
activate DB
DB --> Worker: Return current result
deactivate DB

Worker -> Worker: Merge new data into result:\nresult["summary"] = summary\nresult["context_analysis"] = {...}

Worker -> DB: Update Task:\n- status = "summarized"\n- result = {merged result}\n- summary = summary text (direct field)
activate DB
DB --> Worker: Updated
deactivate DB

Worker --> Redis: Task completed
deactivate Worker

== 6. UI Polls & Displays Results ==

loop Every 2 seconds

  UI -> API: GET /api/v1/audio/v2/tasks/{task_id}/status
  activate API

  API -> DB: Get Task.result
  activate DB
  DB --> API: Return task with full result
  deactivate DB

  API --> UI: Return {\n  status: "summarized",\n  summary: "...",\n  context_analysis: {\n    entities: [...],\n    insights: [...],\n    ...\n  }\n}
  deactivate API

  alt Status = "summarized"
    UI -> UI: Stop polling
    UI -> UI: Display summary\nShow "View Summary" button\nShow entities, insights
    UI -> User: Show success notification

    User -> UI: Click "View Summary"
    UI -> UI: Expand summary panel:\n- Summary text (+ Copy button)\n- Entities list\n- Insights list\n- Relationships (if available)
  end

end

deactivate UI

note over Context, LLM
  **Multi-Layer Context Analysis**

  Layer 1: Entity Extraction
    → People, Locations, Organizations, Times, Money

  Layer 2: Relationship Mining
    → Direct & hidden relationships, influence mapping

  Layer 3: Action & Decision Tracking
    → Commitments, offers, decisions, requests

  Layer 4: Risk & Anomaly Detection
    → Time contradictions, evasion, suspicious language

  Layer 5: Deep Insights
    → Key takeaways, actionable intelligence, recommendations

  This comprehensive analysis ensures
  NO INFORMATION IS LOST!
end note

note over Worker
  **Summary Types**

  1. Brief (1-2 sentences, < 50 words)
     - Quick overview
     - Main point only

  2. Detailed (50-200 words)
     - Main content
     - Key points
     - Conclusions

  3. Investigation (Specialized)
     - Event timeline
     - Participants & roles
     - Anomalies & evidence
     - Points to clarify
     - Investigation recommendations

  Investigation mode uses advanced
  prompt engineering with Chain-of-Thought
  and Persona Prompting techniques.
end note

@enduml
